Unofficial OpenVINO INT4 conversion of z-lab/Qwen3.5-4B-DFlash
https://github.com/jmwrockon/qwen35-4b-dflash-openvino

This work is a modified version of the model z-lab/Qwen3.5-4B-DFlash,
revision 9a1996ccf887b79ab3af4fcbf8c1d1f4b5658bcf
(https://huggingface.co/z-lab/Qwen3.5-4B-DFlash), a DFlash draft model for
Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B that Z-Lab (https://z-lab.ai) publishes under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. Its model card describes it as "a joint retrain from
Z-Lab and Modal"; Modal (https://modal.com) publishes the same weights as
modal-labs/Qwen3.5-4B-DFlash.

DFlash is described in: Jian Chen, Yesheng Liang and Zhijian Liu,
"DFlash: Block Diffusion for Flash Speculative Decoding",
arXiv:2602.06036 (https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.06036).

The base model is Qwen3.5-4B (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B) by the
Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud, under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(Copyright 2026 Alibaba Cloud).

Neither z-lab/Qwen3.5-4B-DFlash nor Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B has a NOTICE file.
This conversion is not affiliated with or endorsed by Z-Lab, Modal, the
OpenVINO project or Intel, the Qwen team or Alibaba Cloud.


Changes made (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))
-----------------------------------------------

On 2026-10-07 the maintainer of this repository (GitHub: jmwrockon)
converted the model from PyTorch safetensors (bfloat16) to OpenVINO IR, with
the weights compressed to 4 bits (NNCF int4_asym, group size 128, all layers,
no calibration data). The conversion used OpenVINO Model Server 2026.4.1's
pull mode, which ran optimum-cli export openvino (optimum-intel 2.2.0) with
openvino 2026.4.0, nncf 3.4.0 and transformers 5.5.4.

Every model file here was written by that conversion:

  openvino_model.xml, openvino_model.bin
      The draft network as OpenVINO IR, its weights compressed from
      bfloat16 to INT4. They replace the original model.safetensors.

  config.json
      The original's config.json as rewritten by the exporter: it adds
      "_orig_attn_implementation" and sets "tie_word_embeddings" to false
      and "transformers_version" to 5.5.4. The exporter also pointed
      "auto_map" at its model patcher by a path on the converting machine;
      that key was then removed by hand, so this config.json has no
      "auto_map" (the original's named dflash.DFlashDraftModel).

  generation_config.json, openvino_config.json
      Written by the exporter.

  tokenizer.json, tokenizer_config.json, openvino_tokenizer.xml,
  openvino_tokenizer.bin, openvino_detokenizer.xml, openvino_detokenizer.bin
      Written by the exporter. The original has no tokenizer files.

README.md, NOTICE, SHA256SUMS, .gitattributes and .gitignore were written for
this repository. LICENSE is the Apache License 2.0 as published at
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt, because the original
repository has no LICENSE file of its own (its model card declares
apache-2.0).
